{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "title": "Mosaico Ideas immutable upload manifest 1 draft",
  "description": "CONFIRMED DRAFT. Root manifest inside one immutable Mosaico Ideas release ZIP. Each file is declared once. Archive, semantic, byte-level, compatibility and publisher checks remain mandatory. Vibe Mode self-update is out of scope.",
  "type": "object",
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "required": [
    "schema",
    "project",
    "firmware",
    "website",
    "device"
  ],
  "properties": {
    "schema": {
      "const": "mosaico-ideas/release/1"
    },
    "project": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "title",
        "categories"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "title": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1,
          "maxLength": 200
        },
        "categories": {
          "type": "array",
          "minItems": 1,
          "maxItems": 6,
          "uniqueItems": true,
          "items": {
            "enum": [
              "smart-home",
              "sensors",
              "display",
              "audio",
              "communication",
              "motor"
            ]
          }
        },
        "boards": {
          "type": "array",
          "minItems": 0,
          "maxItems": 2,
          "uniqueItems": true,
          "items": {
            "enum": [
              "camera",
              "ethernet",
              "battery"
            ]
          }
        },
        "tags": {
          "type": "array",
          "minItems": 0,
          "maxItems": 20,
          "uniqueItems": true,
          "items": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "maxLength": 50
          }
        },
        "license": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 0,
          "maxLength": 500
        },
        "external_links": {
          "type": "array",
          "minItems": 0,
          "maxItems": 10,
          "uniqueItems": true,
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "required": [
              "label",
              "url",
              "platform"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "label": {
                "type": "string",
                "minLength": 1,
                "maxLength": 120
              },
              "url": {
                "type": "string",
                "minLength": 1,
                "maxLength": 2048,
                "pattern": "^https?://"
              },
              "platform": {
                "enum": [
                  "github",
                  "oshwhub",
                  "makerworld",
                  "other"
                ]
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "firmware": {
      "allOf": [
        {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/file"
        },
        {
          "properties": {
            "size": {
              "maximum": 33554432
            },
            "path": {
              "pattern": "\\.irisfw$"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "description": "One ordinary Idea .irisfw preserved as an opaque file in the outer ZIP. Its internal manifest owns version, target and install plan. Protected system firmware components are not accepted."
    },
    "website": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "readme"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "readme": {
          "allOf": [
            {
              "$ref": "#/$defs/file"
            },
            {
              "properties": {
                "size": {
                  "maximum": 400000
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "description": "Nonempty UTF-8 Markdown, at most 100000 Unicode code points and 400000 bytes. Both limits require inspection of actual file content."
        },
        "changelog": {
          "allOf": [
            {
              "$ref": "#/$defs/file"
            },
            {
              "properties": {
                "size": {
                  "maximum": 40000
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "description": "Optional nonempty UTF-8 Markdown, at most 10000 Unicode code points and 40000 bytes. Both limits require inspection of actual file content."
        },
        "covers": {
          "type": "array",
          "minItems": 0,
          "maxItems": 9,
          "uniqueItems": true,
          "items": {
            "allOf": [
              {
                "$ref": "#/$defs/file"
              },
              {
                "properties": {
                  "size": {
                    "maximum": 10485760
                  }
                }
              }
            ],
            "description": "Single-frame JPEG, PNG, GIF or WebP, each at most 10 MiB, width and height each 1-4096 pixels. Reject APNG and animated WebP; GIF must contain one frame. A 16:9 aspect ratio is recommended, not required. Array order is display order. Actual bytes must be decoded and checked."
          }
        },
        "resources": {
          "type": "array",
          "minItems": 0,
          "maxItems": 100,
          "uniqueItems": true,
          "items": {
            "allOf": [
              {
                "$ref": "#/$defs/file"
              },
              {
                "properties": {
                  "size": {
                    "maximum": 20971520
                  }
                }
              }
            ],
            "description": "Website resource, at most 20 MiB. Images must be single-frame JPEG/PNG/GIF/WebP, at most 10 MiB, width and height each 1-4096 pixels; reject APNG and animated WebP. Content validation must apply image limits to actual bytes."
          }
        },
        "attachments": {
          "type": "array",
          "minItems": 0,
          "maxItems": 20,
          "uniqueItems": true,
          "items": {
            "allOf": [
              {
                "$ref": "#/$defs/file"
              },
              {
                "properties": {
                  "size": {
                    "maximum": 20971520
                  }
                }
              }
            ],
            "description": "Downloadable attachment, at most 20 MiB. Images must be single-frame JPEG/PNG/GIF/WebP, at most 10 MiB, width and height each 1-4096 pixels; reject APNG and animated WebP. Content validation must apply image limits to actual bytes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "device": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/ideaDevice"
    }
  },
  "$defs": {
    "file": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "path",
        "size",
        "sha256"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "path": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1,
          "maxLength": 192,
          "pattern": "^[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9._-]{0,63}(/[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9._-]{0,63}){0,3}$",
          "not": {
            "enum": [
              "manifest.json",
              "MANIFEST.JSON"
            ]
          }
        },
        "size": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 1,
          "maximum": 33554432
        },
        "sha256": {
          "type": "string",
          "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{64}$"
        }
      },
      "description": "Root-relative ordinary file. Semantic validation also rejects case-folded reserved names, duplicate paths and file/directory prefix conflicts."
    },
    "ideaDevice": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "profile",
        "default_locale",
        "presentations"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "profile": {
          "const": "esp-mosaico/v2"
        },
        "default_locale": {
          "enum": [
            "zh-CN",
            "en"
          ]
        },
        "presentations": {
          "type": "array",
          "minItems": 2,
          "maxItems": 2,
          "uniqueItems": true,
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "required": [
              "display",
              "assets"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "display": {
                "allOf": [
                  {
                    "$ref": "#/$defs/file"
                  },
                  {
                    "properties": {
                      "size": {
                        "maximum": 32768
                      },
                      "path": {
                        "enum": [
                          "device/zh-CN/display.json",
                          "device/en/display.json"
                        ]
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "description": "mosaico-ideas/display/1; authoritative locale, name, description, font and icon references."
              },
              "assets": {
                "type": "array",
                "minItems": 1,
                "maxItems": 3,
                "uniqueItems": true,
                "items": {
                  "allOf": [
                    {
                      "$ref": "#/$defs/file"
                    },
                    {
                      "properties": {
                        "size": {
                          "maximum": 1048576
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  ],
                  "description": "Exactly the 1-2 MIFF fonts and optional icon referenced by display. Icon: fixed 64x64 RGBA PNG, bit_depth=8, color_type=6, interlace_method=0, no APNG, at most 65536 bytes. The generic 1 MiB limit accommodates fonts; semantic validation must apply icon limits and decode actual bytes. The display and all assets together are at most 1 MiB per locale."
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "description": "Exactly two self-contained presentations: device/zh-CN/display.json and device/en/display.json. The display locale must equal its directory name.",
          "allOf": [
            {
              "contains": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                  "display"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "display": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "required": [
                      "path"
                    ],
                    "properties": {
                      "path": {
                        "const": "device/zh-CN/display.json"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              },
              "minContains": 1,
              "maxContains": 1
            },
            {
              "contains": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                  "display"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "display": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "required": [
                      "path"
                    ],
                    "properties": {
                      "path": {
                        "const": "device/en/display.json"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              },
              "minContains": 1,
              "maxContains": 1
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "$comment": "First-version contract recorded on 2026-10-14; runtime content validators are implemented and shared by the CLI and test server. Root manifest: at most 65536 bytes. Outer ZIP and extracted outer files including the root: each at most 100 MiB. At most 164 ordinary files including the root, and 512 ZIP entries including directories. Both per-file and aggregate limits apply. Icons require decodable 64x64, 8-bit-per-channel RGBA, non-interlaced PNG with no APNG, at most 65536 bytes. Website images are single-frame JPEG/PNG/GIF/WebP, each at most 10 MiB and 4096 pixels on each axis; no APNG or animated WebP. Display plus assets: at most 1 MiB per locale, 2 MiB for both. String lengths count Unicode code points; byte limits use UTF-8. JSON Schema cannot inspect external bytes, count the dependency closure or resolve display.icon. See README.zh-CN.md for mandatory semantic checks and author source-image limits."
}
